    "voice": "produce_events/200600403/2006004030010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あいたたた……\r\nって、咲耶！？　すまん、大丈夫か！？",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charCategory": "stand_fix",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "006",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bgm": "017",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 300
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004030020,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ……私は大丈夫だよ\r\nこちらこそ、タイミング悪くすまないね",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600403/2006004030020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004030030,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "足音が聞こえたものだから、\r\nプロデューサーが帰ってきたのかと思って",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600403/2006004030030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004030040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "今まさに出迎えようとしたところで……\r\nこのありさま、というわけさ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600403/2006004030040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだったのか……\r\n待たせて悪かったな、事務所に誰もいないのに",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004030050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "いいや、何も謝ることはないよ\r\nアナタは真摯に誠実に、きちんと連絡をくれていただろう？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600403/2006004030050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004030060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それともアナタは、私が連絡をしていても遅刻を咎める、\r\nそんな人間だと思っているのかな？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600403/2006004030060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004030070,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それならば、\r\n私に対する認識を改めてもらう必要がありそうだね？",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600403/2006004030070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "さ、咲耶？　俺はなにもそんなつもりじゃ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004030080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "なんて、冗談さ。打ち合わせを始めようじゃないか\r\nアナタが持ってきてくれた、とっておきの仕事の話をね",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600403/2006004030080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、ああ……いや、仕事の話の前に……\r\n咲耶、何かあったのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004030090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "え？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600403/2006004030090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えって……\r\nいや、いつもと様子が違う気がするから……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004030100,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そんなことないよ。私は、いつも通りで……\r\n…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600403/2006004030100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004030110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……本当に、何でもないんだ\r\n事務所はとても静かなものだった",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600403/2006004030110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "何でもないのに、咲耶はそんな顔しないだろ",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3000
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004030120,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……フフ、そうだね",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600403/2006004030120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004030130,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……アナタは本当に、私のことをよく見ているね\r\n時折、アナタが怖い、とすら思ってしまうよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600403/2006004030130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004030140,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……今日は、事務所に誰もいなくてとても静かで……\r\nだから少し……思い出したんだ。幼い頃のことを",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600403/2006004030140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "幼い頃か……\r\n咲耶の家は、確か……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004030150,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ。私は父とふたりで暮らしていたんだ\r\nとても優しかったけれど……いつも遅くまで働いていたよ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600403/2006004030150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004030160,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "だから夜は、幼い頃からひとりで父の帰りを待つことが多かった\r\n……思い出したのは、そんな時のことさ",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600403/2006004030160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004030170,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "夜になると、父は必ず電話をくれたんだ\r\n忙しかっただろうに……今思うとマメな人だった",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600403/2006004030170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004030180,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ひとりで大丈夫か、寂しくないか……\r\n受話器越しに、私を思う温もりが伝わってくるものだったよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600403/2006004030180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いいお父さんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004030190,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そうだね、私もそう思うよ\r\n……でも、だから全然平気だ、なんて心からは言えなかった",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600403/2006004030190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004030200,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "優しい電話の声の主は遠くにいて、\r\n私ひとりの部屋はどうしようもなく静かで……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600403/2006004030200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004030210,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "まるで、世界にひとりぼっちになってしまったような感覚\r\n……どうしてか今日は、それを思い出してしまった",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600403/2006004030210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004030220,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それはきっと、今日がとても静かで……\r\n……アナタの電話が、父に似ていたから",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600403/2006004030220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004030230,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、ほんの少しのセンチメンタルさ\r\nよくあることだろう？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600403/2006004030230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004030240,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "すまない、そんな顔をさせるつもりはなかったんだ\r\n……やはり、過去のことなんて話すものではないね",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600403/2006004030240"
  },
  {
    "select": "話してくれて\r\nありがとう",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "待っていてくれて\r\nありがとう",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "待たせてすまない",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004030250,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、アナタでなければ話すこともなかったさ\r\n明日にでも忘れてくれて構わないよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600403/2006004030250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004030260,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "仕事なのだから、私たちの都合だけでは\r\nどうにもならないだろう？",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600403/2006004030260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そ、そうか……？\r\nなんだか、俺が気を遣われてるみたいだな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004030270,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ。私は大丈夫だよ。もう小さな子どもではないし\r\nそれに、アナタのことならいつまでも待っていられるんだ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600403/2006004030270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004030280,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "どんなに遅くなっても\r\nプロデューサーは、必ず来てくれる……だろ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600403/2006004030280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、当たり前だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004030290,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、一体この世界のうち何人が\r\n迷いもなく当たり前と答えてくれるのだろうね？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600403/2006004030290"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004030300,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタみたいな人がプロデューサーだから……\r\n私はきっと、アイドルを続けていけるんだろうな",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600403/2006004030300"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004030310,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "お礼を言われるようなことではないさ\r\nプロデューサーこそ、急いできてくれてありがとう",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600403/2006004030310"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え……どうして俺が急いでいたなんて分かるんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004030320,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタのことならなんでもお見通しさ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600403/2006004030320"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004030330,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "なんて、帰ってきたときの様子を見れば誰でもわかるよ\r\n真剣な顔で、肩で息をしていたじゃないか",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600403/2006004030330"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど……\r\n咲耶には隠し事はできそうにないな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004030340,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、アナタのことは、\r\nそれなりによく見ているつもりだよ",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600403/2006004030340"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004030350,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタに一方的に見抜かれてばかりでは、\r\n私の性に合わないからね",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600403/2006004030350"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004030360,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "謝らなくていいよ\r\n私だって、仕事が長引くのは何度も経験してる",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600403/2006004030360"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004030370,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それでも、そんなに申し訳なさそうな顔をするなら……\r\nそうだね、お詫びとして、コーヒーを淹れてくれないかな？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600403/2006004030370"
  },
